# TPOWER Page Quality Standard (VIP Benchmark)

The **VIP page** (`/[locale]/vip`) is the content-depth and EEAT benchmark for the entire website.

Future major landing pages must **not** be thin marketing shells. Match VIP-level depth, structure, and SEO hygiene unless the user explicitly requests a thinner page.

## Minimum content depth

| Page | Target words |
|------|----------------|
| Home | 3000–3500 |
| Providers | 2500–3500 |
| Promotions | 2500–3000 |
| Download | 2200–2800 |
| Games | 3000–4000 |
| Slots | 3000–3500 |
| Live Casino | 3000–3500 |
| Sports | 2500–3000 |
| Fishing | 2500–3000 |
| Crash Games | 2000–2500 |
| Lottery | 2000–2500 |
| VIP | 2500–3500 |
| FAQ | 2000+ |
| Each provider page | 1200–1800 |
| Each game page | 800–1200 |

## Section checklist (use as applicable)

Hero · Trust bar/marquee · Benefits · Features · Comparison table · Timeline/process · Statistics · Popular games · Provider showcase · Testimonials · FAQ · Related guides · Internal links · Latest articles · Responsible gaming · Final CTA

## SEO checklist (every major page)

- SEO title + meta description
- Open Graph + Twitter cards
- Canonical URL (+ hreflang via `buildMetadata`)
- Breadcrumb schema
- Organization schema (hub/pillar pages)
- FAQ schema where FAQs exist
- Article schema where applicable
- Internal linking + proper heading hierarchy
- Image alt text, optimized sizes, lazy loading where appropriate
- Semantic HTML and Core Web Vitals awareness

Use `buildMetadata` from `src/lib/seo.ts` and schema helpers from `src/lib/schema.ts`.

## Content / EEAT rules

- Original, useful copy — no filler, no duplicate paragraphs, no keyword stuffing
- Demonstrate Experience, Expertise, Authority, Trustworthiness
- Natural English; Chinese pages rewritten from scratch (see bilingual + Chinese brand rules)
- Primary Chinese brand: **TPOWER线上博彩** (not default 娱乐城)
- Keep TPOWER red/black visual system (Games / VIP quality UI)

## Conversion & engagement

- Strong hero CTAs
- Clear process/timelines
- Comparison aids for decision-making
- FAQ that mirrors real search questions
- Related guides for internal PageRank and time-on-page
- Premium final CTA (Register + Download App pattern)

## Responsive

Follow `tpower-desktop-first-responsive.mdc`: desktop composition is canonical; mobile only scales (horizontal scroll for card rows; no layout redesign).

When expanding or creating landing pages, default to this VIP-comparable standard.
